method: |
  Self-consistent forward walk through (u32 alphabet, u32 min) headers
  starting at 0x0005c304; this is the unique walk that
  lands EXACTLY at the codebook-descriptor boundary 0x0005d214.
  All sixteen tables consume the 3856 B between those bounds with no gap.
notes: |
  Pure byte-level extraction; no semantic claim about the role of this
  table (stage count vs. mean, intra vs. inter, level binding).
  See provenance/07-extractor-vlc-tables.md for the brief-vs-binary
  reconciliation that motivates the neutral naming.
